WEBVTT

00:07:28.819 --> 00:07:31.947
or that are just too dangerous
to test on real streets.

00:07:31.947 --> 00:07:33.908
That is the truth,

00:07:33.908 --> 00:07:37.453
and it will be the truth
for a very long time.

00:07:37.661 --> 00:07:40.873
Human beings are pretty underrated
in their abilities.

00:07:41.373 --> 00:07:44.251
So what we do is we use simulation.

00:07:44.585 --> 00:07:46.253
And with simulation,

00:07:46.253 --> 00:07:50.174
we’re able to construct
millions of scenarios

00:07:50.174 --> 00:07:51.842
in a fabricated environment

00:07:51.842 --> 00:07:54.887
so that we can see
how our software would react.

00:07:55.221 --> 00:07:57.014
And that’s the simulation footage.

00:07:57.014 --> 00:07:59.308
You can see we’re building the world,

00:07:59.308 --> 00:08:00.559
we’re putting in scenarios